{"pageid":4655,"title":"Speaker Text Formatting","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Speaker Text Formatting</span>","revid":20372,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>This page is for <b>Speaker</b> Text Formatting. For <b>Signs</b>, go to <a href=\"/wiki/Sign_Text_Formatting\" title=\"Sign Text Formatting\">Sign Text Formatting</a>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"About\">About</span></h2>\n<p>Rich text tags are similar to XML/HTML tags where you must include both an opening and closing tag around the text. These allow you to change the font style, and have unique and interesting <a href=\"/wiki/Speaker\" title=\"Speaker\">Speaker</a> text!\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Tags_List.5B1.5D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tags_List[1]\">Tags List<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-:0&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-:0-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></span></h2>\n<p><b><u>Bold</u></b>: <b>&lt;b&gt;</b>Lorem Ipsum<b>&lt;/b&gt;</b> | Makes text <b>bold</b>.\n</p><p><b><u>Italics</u></b>: <b>&lt;i&gt;</b>Lorem Ipsum<b>&lt;/i&gt;</b> | Makes text <i>italic</i>.\n</p><p><b><u>Underline</u></b>: <b>&lt;u&gt;</b>Lorem Ipsum<b>&lt;/u&gt;</b> | Adds an <u>underline</u> to text.\n</p><p><b><u>Strikethrough</u></b>: <b>&lt;s&gt;</b>Lorem Ipsum<b>&lt;/s&gt;</b> | <s>Strikes out</s> text.\n</p><p><b><u>Smallcaps</u></b>: <b>&lt;sc&gt;</b>Lorem Ipsum<b>&lt;/sc&gt;</b> | Turns text into Sᴍᴀʟʟᴄᴀᴘs.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 425px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/57/Rich_speaker_collage_2.png/revision/latest?cb=20251107012508\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A speaker using bold, italic, underlined, and smallcaps text at the same time\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"425\" height=\"37\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Rich speaker collage 2.png\" data-image-key=\"Rich_speaker_collage_2.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/57/Rich_speaker_collage_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/425?cb=20251107012508\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/57/Rich_speaker_collage_2.png/revision/latest?cb=20251107012508\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A speaker using bold, italic, underlined, and smallcaps text at the same time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/57/Rich_speaker_collage_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/425?cb=20251107012508\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"425\" height=\"37\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Rich speaker collage 2.png\" data-image-key=\"Rich_speaker_collage_2.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/57/Rich_speaker_collage_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/425?cb=20251107012508\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Rich_speaker_collage_2.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">A speaker using bold, italic, underlined, and smallcaps text at the same time</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>You can nest multiple tags within each other, as long as the closing tags are in the reverse order. For example, <b>&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;sc&gt;</b>This text is bold, italic, underlined, and in small caps!<b>&lt;/sc&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;</b> would create \"This text is bold, italic, underlined, and in small caps!\" in bold, italic, underlined, and in smallcaps. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Keywords\">Keywords</span></h2>\n<p>Speakers have two unique \"tags\", referred to ingame as Keywords. These work using signal values.\n</p><p><b><u>Number</u></b>: <b><code>{num}</code></b> | Chats the power value it receives. For example, pressing a <a href=\"/wiki/Button\" title=\"Button\">Button</a> will make it say \"<b>10</b>\", or connecting it to a <a href=\"/wiki/Number_Interface\" title=\"Number Interface\">Number Interface</a> with an input of 123 will make it say \"<b>123</b>\".\n</p><p><b><u>Name</u></b>: <b><code>{display_name}</code></b> | Chats the display name of the UserID it receives. For example, connecting it to a number interface with an input of 155551426 will make it say \"<b>Beta</b>\", the display name of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Player:Beta_Protogen\">Beta_Protogen</a> (UserID 155551426).\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 416px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c5/Rich_speaker_collage.png/revision/latest?cb=20251107011919\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A mixture of tags and keywords used together in a speaker.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"416\" height=\"30\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Rich speaker collage.png\" data-image-key=\"Rich_speaker_collage.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c5/Rich_speaker_collage.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/416?cb=20251107011919\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c5/Rich_speaker_collage.png/revision/latest?cb=20251107011919\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A mixture of tags and keywords used together in a speaker.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c5/Rich_speaker_collage.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/416?cb=20251107011919\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"416\" height=\"30\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Rich speaker collage.png\" data-image-key=\"Rich_speaker_collage.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c5/Rich_speaker_collage.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/416?cb=20251107011919\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Rich_speaker_collage.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">A mixture of tags and keywords used together in a speaker.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>These can be inserted between text, and can even be formatted with the above Tags. For example, connecting a speaker to the top wire slot of a <a href=\"/wiki/Donator\" title=\"Donator\">Donator</a> and setting the speaker's text to \"<code><b>&lt;b&gt;</b>Thank you for your donation, <b>&lt;i&gt;</b>{display_name}<b>&lt;/i&gt;</b>!<b>&lt;/b&gt;</b> Fun fact: Your UserID is <b>&lt;u&gt;{num}&lt;/u&gt;</b>!\" will output the first whole sentence in bold, display name in italics, and UserID underlined.</code>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Escape_Forms.5B1.5D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Escape_Forms[1]\">Escape Forms<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-:0&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-:0-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></span></h2>\n<p>If you want to render certain characters like &lt; or &gt; and exempt them from consideration as part of rich text tags, you can write them in their <b>escape form</b>. Just write the text that's under \"Escape\" and it should convert it to the Character version on signs in the game.\n</p>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\">\n<caption>Table of escape forms, their usages, and outcomes.\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Character\n</th>\n<th>Escape\n</th>\n<th>Example\n</th>\n<th>Result\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&lt;\n</td>\n<td>&#x26;lt;\n</td>\n<td>x <b>&#x26;lt;</b> y\n</td>\n<td>x &lt; y\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt;\n</td>\n<td>&#x26;gt;\n</td>\n<td>x <b>&#x26;gt;</b> y\n</td>\n<td>y &gt; x\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\"\n</td>\n<td>&#x26;quot;\n</td>\n<td><b>&#x26;quot;</b>x<b>&#x26;quot;</b>\n</td>\n<td>\"x\"\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>'\n</td>\n<td>&#x26;apos;\n</td>\n<td><b>&#x26;apos;</b>xyz<b>&#x26;apos;</b>\n</td>\n<td>'xyz'\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&amp;\n</td>\n<td>&#x26;amp;\n</td>\n<td>yes <b>&#x26;amp;</b> no\n</td>\n<td>yes &amp; no\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Rich text tags like Color (<code>&lt;color #&gt;&lt;/color&gt;</code>) and Font (<code>&lt;font Arial&gt;&lt;/font&gt;</code>) have been tested and unfortunately <b>do not work.</b>\n<ul><li>These tags will break speakers and show a mess of code instead of outputting the desired result.</li></ul></li>\n<li>If a rich text tag doesn't work in a speaker, it will disappear from the text box entirely when confirmed.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"82316dda49a0c6c4aa4617a6e0347dc1\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:102px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Rich_speaker_i_b_ul-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:51px; width:185px; top:24.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Rich_speaker_i_b_ul.png\" title=\"Rich speaker i b ul.png (16 KB)\" style=\"height:51px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d9/Rich_speaker_i_b_ul.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251107012254\" title=\"Rich speaker i b ul.png (16 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Italic, Bold, and Underline\" height=\"52\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Rich speaker i b ul.png\" data-image-key=\"Rich_speaker_i_b_ul.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Italic, Bold, and Underline\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Rich speaker i b ul.png (16 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Italic, Bold, and Underline\" height=\"52\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Rich speaker i b ul.png\" data-image-key=\"Rich_speaker_i_b_ul.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Italic, Bold, and Underline\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d9/Rich_speaker_i_b_ul.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251107012254\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Italic, Bold, and Underline</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:102px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Rich_speaker_s-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:23px; width:185px; top:38.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Rich_speaker_s.png\" title=\"Rich speaker s.png (12 KB)\" style=\"height:23px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9a/Rich_speaker_s.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251107012315\" title=\"Rich speaker s.png (12 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Strikethrough\" height=\"26\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Rich speaker s.png\" data-image-key=\"Rich_speaker_s.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Strikethrough\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Rich speaker s.png (12 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Strikethrough\" height=\"26\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Rich speaker s.png\" data-image-key=\"Rich_speaker_s.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Strikethrough\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9a/Rich_speaker_s.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251107012315\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Strikethrough</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:102px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Rich_speaker_sc-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:16px; width:185px; top:42px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Rich_speaker_sc.png\" title=\"Rich speaker sc.png (13 KB)\" style=\"height:16px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f3/Rich_speaker_sc.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251107012333\" title=\"Rich speaker sc.png (13 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Smallcaps\" height=\"23\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Rich speaker sc.png\" data-image-key=\"Rich_speaker_sc.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Smallcaps\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Rich speaker sc.png (13 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Smallcaps\" height=\"23\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Rich speaker sc.png\" data-image-key=\"Rich_speaker_sc.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Smallcaps\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f3/Rich_speaker_sc.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251107012333\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Smallcaps</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:102px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Rich_speaker_broken-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:15px; width:185px; top:42.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Rich_speaker_broken.png\" title=\"Rich speaker broken.png (32 KB)\" style=\"height:15px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e8/Rich_speaker_broken.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251107012530\" title=\"Rich speaker broken.png (32 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Broken speaker trying to say unsupported tags\" height=\"36\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Rich speaker broken.png\" data-image-key=\"Rich_speaker_broken.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Broken speaker trying to say unsupported tags\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Rich speaker broken.png (32 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Broken speaker trying to say unsupported tags\" height=\"36\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Rich speaker broken.png\" data-image-key=\"Rich_speaker_broken.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Broken speaker trying to say unsupported tags\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e8/Rich_speaker_broken.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251107012530\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Broken speaker trying to say unsupported tags</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:102px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Speaker_num_keyword-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:100px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Speaker_num_keyword.png\" title=\"Speaker num keyword.png (400 KB)\" style=\"height:100px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/32/Speaker_num_keyword.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251107014003\" title=\"Speaker num keyword.png (400 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"A speaker outputting the Number Interface&#039;s value of 123 using the {num} keyword.\" height=\"100\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Speaker num keyword.png\" data-image-key=\"Speaker_num_keyword.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"A speaker outputting the Number Interface&#039;s value of 123 using the {num} keyword.\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Speaker num keyword.png (400 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"A speaker outputting the Number Interface&#39;s value of 123 using the {num} keyword.\" height=\"100\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Speaker num keyword.png\" data-image-key=\"Speaker_num_keyword.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"A speaker outputting the Number Interface&#39;s value of 123 using the {num} keyword.\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/32/Speaker_num_keyword.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251107014003\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">A speaker outputting the Number Interface's value of 123 using the {num} keyword.</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-:0-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-:0_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-:0_1-1\">1.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://create.roblox.com/docs/en-us/ui/rich-text\">https://create.roblox.com/docs/en-us/ui/rich-text</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831194943\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 138/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expan